00:17:11.120 --> 00:17:14.750
Sorry, I've been riding her hard all night.

00:17:14.750 --> 00:17:17.200
Seriously? That's ridiculous...

00:17:17.200 --> 00:17:18.700
Okay, everybody!

00:17:18.700 --> 00:17:21.620
It's almost time for that
gang of thieves to get here.

00:17:21.620 --> 00:17:24.200
I need you all to provide backup.

00:17:24.200 --> 00:17:26.620
How'd it go with Cecil?

00:17:26.620 --> 00:17:28.620
Shut up. We're on the clock.

00:17:41.540 --> 00:17:44.290
The target's here.
Everybody stay on standby.

00:17:45.950 --> 00:17:47.370
Okay, looking good.

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:51.450
Wait, wait!

00:17:51.450 --> 00:17:54.080
Looks like somebody betrayed somebody.
He's agitated.

00:17:54.080 --> 00:17:56.120
Not good! All units, head in!

00:17:56.120 --> 00:17:57.120
Go! Go! Go!

00:17:59.910 --> 00:18:01.000
--Don't move! This is the police!

00:18:01.000 --> 00:18:02.750
--Shit!
--Don't move! This is the police!

00:18:02.750 --> 00:18:03.620
You bastard!

00:18:03.620 --> 00:18:05.410
No! You'll shoot the hostage!

00:18:10.160 --> 00:18:11.750
They got away! Tony's in danger!

00:18:11.750 --> 00:18:13.500
I'm sorry, Detective!

00:18:13.500 --> 00:18:15.410
Shit! My eyes!

00:18:15.410 --> 00:18:16.870
Leave it to me.

00:18:16.870 --> 00:18:17.910
Tilarna?

00:18:18.450 --> 00:18:21.000
Come on! We're saving Tony, right?

00:18:21.580 --> 00:18:23.290
Wait! What are you doing?

00:18:23.290 --> 00:18:24.330
Let's go!

00:18:25.160 --> 00:18:27.040
It's in reverse! Reverse!

00:18:27.040 --> 00:18:28.750
This is what I meant to do!

00:18:40.330 --> 00:18:42.910
Wrong lane! You're in the wrong lane!

00:18:47.120 --> 00:18:48.660
I'm starting to get it!

00:18:48.660 --> 00:18:50.790
This "speed" stuff isn't bad...

00:18:50.790 --> 00:18:53.750
This is what it feels like to be high!

00:18:53.750 --> 00:18:55.910
No more! Just kill me!

00:18:55.910 --> 00:18:58.540
The window's right there!
Jump out if you want to!

00:19:00.080 --> 00:19:01.040
Got 'em!

00:19:01.040 --> 00:19:02.620
No! Stop it!

00:19:18.540 --> 00:19:19.540
Shit!

00:19:19.540 --> 00:19:21.080
Hey, Tilarna...

00:19:34.410 --> 00:19:36.830
Tony, you okay?

00:19:36.830 --> 00:19:41.000
Sorry. I didn't expect trouble like this.

00:19:41.000 --> 00:19:44.000
It's fine. Just relax a bit.

00:19:44.000 --> 00:19:45.500
Now then...

00:19:47.000 --> 00:19:49.660
Fortunately, nobody died.

00:19:49.660 --> 00:19:52.200
But never drive like that again.

00:19:52.200 --> 00:19:53.790
But I was useful!

00:19:53.790 --> 00:19:55.450
That was "useful"? Don't be ridi--

00:19:55.450 --> 00:19:57.950
Don't treat me like baggage!

00:19:59.120 --> 00:20:00.660
I don't just mean driving.

00:20:00.660 --> 00:20:03.200
I'm studying every day.

00:20:03.200 --> 00:20:07.000
If you won't understand that, who will?

00:20:09.080 --> 00:20:10.540
I'm sorry.

00:20:10.540 --> 00:20:12.750
I went a little too far before.

00:20:12.750 --> 00:20:15.040
I don't think you're useless.

00:20:15.040 --> 00:20:16.330
Really?

00:20:16.330 --> 00:20:17.540
Yeah.

00:20:17.540 --> 00:20:19.540
Really, really?

00:20:19.540 --> 00:20:21.120
Really.

00:20:21.120 --> 00:20:23.750
Forget about the banged-up car.

00:20:23.750 --> 00:20:27.000
The new one's repairable, probably.

00:20:27.000 --> 00:20:29.330
Once it's out of the shop,
I'll practice with you.

00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:30.540
Really?

00:20:30.540 --> 00:20:32.500
Don't get so excited.

00:20:32.500 --> 00:20:35.910
But promise me that next time you'll drive safe--

00:20:47.910 --> 00:20:50.200
The damage seems to have gotten a bit worse.

00:20:50.200 --> 00:20:51.370
But it's still fixable, right?

00:20:51.370 --> 00:20:55.500
Like hell it's fixable, you goddamn alien!

00:21:10.370 --> 00:21:11.830
I'm back...

00:21:13.040 --> 00:21:15.330
Kuroi! Hello!

00:21:17.910 --> 00:21:19.620
You're finally home, huh?

00:21:19.620 --> 00:21:22.250
I had to deal with the
aftermath of that car chase,

00:21:22.250 --> 00:21:25.750
and then got in an argument with
the real estate guy about your new place...

00:21:25.750 --> 00:21:27.620
What are you doing?

00:21:27.620 --> 00:21:29.870
Welcoming you to my home.
This way.

00:21:35.790 --> 00:21:36.910
Well?

00:21:36.910 --> 00:21:39.160
From now on, this is my room.

00:21:39.160 --> 00:21:42.620
You're the second guest I've had, after Kuroi.

00:21:42.620 --> 00:21:45.000
You should feel honored.

00:21:45.000 --> 00:21:47.910
This is my house, actually.

00:21:47.910 --> 00:21:50.910
Don't worry about it.
It doesn't bother me.

00:21:50.910 --> 00:21:52.500
Sheesh...

00:21:52.500 --> 00:21:56.200
What? Are you still mad about that silly car?

00:21:56.200 --> 00:21:58.080
It's not sil--

00:22:00.290 --> 00:22:03.540
No, it's gone and it's not coming back.

00:22:03.540 --> 00:22:05.120
I'm not mad anymore.

00:22:05.120 --> 00:22:06.370
I see!

00:22:06.370 --> 00:22:07.580
Okay then!

00:23:42.000 --> 00:23:47.000
"Next time"
Next time on <i>COP CRAFT</i>.
